da71e28ac64283071","event_uuid":"54a3ae73-6b7b-4cf0-9bd0-168d16c7abad","position":{"commit_sha":"83930e9822922e78528622b8816e81bf03f1f106","position":"1795114696922073815-54a3ae73-6b7b-4cf0-9bd0-168d16c7abad"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null},{"content_hash":"43eb52e5481d4d964ad9c085b5f94c0a66404df5d9eec2b6307b047530cea857","event_uuid":"be6f41b2-ccae-4243-ab33-6e9e569d54c8","position":{"commit_sha":"a9306fbbdac3bc0babdeba5cf9119cc81a1cc299","position":"1795114805773578379-be6f41b2-ccae-4243-ab33-6e9e569d54c8"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null},{"content_hash":"acc654daa6e293d0cae613b2132a87e0b618a1bedb309dd96503f450950bcc18","event_uuid":"1703d645-44c8-4f71-bcbd-2bbebdedf2f9","position":{"commit_sha":"a9306fbbdac3bc0babdeba5cf9119cc81a1cc299","position":"1795114805791967927-1703d645-44c8-4f71-bcbd-2bbebdedf2f9"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null},{"content_hash":"681f41b08812f384f8c3c74ebb62fb6b1345ed51bbbb77b16f7994f53c071d72","event_uuid":"90e224a8-f565-4e77-8dee-ddd7e9e21a59","position":{"commit_sha":"2430dee49c19be3b603d45c18052e4ce1b8c4f06","position":"1795126029496839045-90e224a8-f565-4e77-8dee-ddd7e9e21a59"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIGNNmnI/WYNJAOKH9yvo0l+tMYJR2tK2UV4H8ReXBQU5 rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com rotated-20260907"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1795113910338166325,"creation_channel":"mcp","deps":[{"link_uuid":"6345a71e-2fa2-4a84-ad0e-211380fbd4d9","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"977f-11fe-1dcb-4b7d"},{"link_uuid":"90e224a8-f565-4e77-8dee-ddd7e9e21a59","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"a978-462c-e959-4c43"}],"description":"## Observation\nIn `sweep (windows)` diag run 44590213544 (throwaway branch `w1-diag-opcert-acl`, the plump-smelly-indianabat fix applied), `tests/unit/test_opcert_service.py::test_completion_pass_spawn_ceiling` (32 git processes, ceiling 30) and `test_completion_fail_spawn_ceiling` (20 processes, ceiling 18) fail. Diffing the job's spawned argv against macOS shows exactly 3 extra steps on Windows. The first is `git show tickets:.bridge_state\\projects.json` where macOS runs `git show tickets:.bridge_state/projects.json`. The other two follow from it: `git add .bridge_state\\projects.json` and `git commit -q --no-verify -m \"chore: seed .bridge_state/projects.json ...\"`. (macOS also runs one `ssh -V` that Windows does not.)\n\n## Cause\n`src/rebar/_store/project_ensures.py:34` builds `_PROJECTS_REL_PATH = os.path.join(\".bridge_state\", \"projects.json\")`. Line 67 uses it in a git revision path, `tickets:{_PROJECTS_REL_PATH}`. Git tree paths always use `/`, so on Windows the lookup never finds the committed file. `seed_projects_mapping_unit` then rewrites the file and runs `git add` + `git commit` on every ensure sweep. The commit has nothing new to record, so its failure is ignored.\n\n## Approach\nMake `_PROJECTS_REL_PATH` the literal `\".bridge_state/projects.json\"`. Git accepts `/` in pathspecs on Windows for `git add`, so the same constant serves both calls. The filesystem path on line 76 keeps `os.path.join`. No config key, env var or flag. Portable: the change removes a platform-dependent separator from a git object path.\n\n## Scope\n- `src/rebar/_store/project_ensures.py` — the constant.\n- `tests/unit/test_project_ensures_git_path.py` (new) — the tests below.\n\n## Testing\n- New test (all platforms): `project_ensures._PROJECTS_REL_PATH == \".bridge_state/projects.json\"`, so the git revision path never carries `\\`.\n- New test (all platforms): on a fresh git repo with a `tickets` branch, the first `seed_projects_mapping_unit` call returns `changed` and commits the file. A second call returns `ok`, and `git rev-parse tickets` is unchanged across it, with the file untouched (same mtime).\n- After merge: the two spawn-ceiling tests pass in a `sweep (windows)` run on main.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] On a tracker where `.bridge_state/projects.json` is already committed, `seed_projects_mapping_unit` returns `ok` without writing or committing, and the git revision path it looks up uses `/` on every platform, both proven by tests.\n- [ ] `test_completion_pass_spawn_ceiling` and `test_completion_fail_spawn_ceiling` pass in a `sweep (windows)` run on main.","env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","file_impact":[{"path":"src/rebar/_store/project_ensures.py","reason":"git revision path uses / on every platform"},{"path":"tests/unit/test_project_ensures_git_path.py","reason":"new tests"}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"last_status_env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","managed_refs":[["relates_to","a978-462c-e959-4c43"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"be6f41b2-ccae-4243-ab33-6e9e569d54c8","plan_review_phase":"execution","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"releases":[],"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"in_progress","tags":["windows","portability"],"ticket_id":"6f5a-b6e4-327e-46b4","ticket_type":"bug","title":"Windows: projects.json seed looks up tickets:.bridge_state\\projects.json, misses it, and rewrites it on every sweep","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["24eb2eed-5786-4c2f-9ace-552a808bb21c","27e47209-f5da-4e67-99c9-21b108dec454","6345a71e-2fa2-4a84-ad0e-211380fbd4d9","2a17559d-d96a-404d-a790-409267106e42","54a3ae73-6b7b-4cf0-9bd0-168d16c7abad","be6f41b2-ccae-4243-ab33-6e9e569d54c8","1703d645-44c8-4f71-bcbd-2bbebdedf2f9","90e224a8-f565-4e77-8dee-ddd7e9e21a59"]},"env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1795126029496839046,"uuid":"56e66903-75b5-4634-8747-542222ebef7a"}